      {
        "id": 218019,
        "name": "Jeysie",
        "username": "Jeysie",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/jeysie/{size}/1868_2.png",
        "created_at": "2018-05-11T13:24:37.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Trajector\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/trajector/48/1914_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Trajector:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I think the hair goes a looooooong way to making her look more like Nightmist and less like Agent Adept.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>True, but I think maybe it's the shape more than the color. I'm picturing the Quando art with red hair and it still makes me think of \"Nightmist with a dye job\". Argent has very straight hair; I imagine it'd look more like Christopher's if it was really long. (Argent also has a very angular face, which also makes the look different.)</p>",
