        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rjc917/{size}/1888_2.png",
        "created_at": "2018-05-17T03:04:58.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I love that we've now gotten two whole episodes off of a single card.</p><p>Am I the only one who thought the Tachyon/Omnitron hybrid Unity was some sort of heroic version of Idesa the Adroit from the Bloodsworn?&nbsp; I can see Tachyon now that they've pointed it out, but that just wasn't coming across when I first looked at the image.</p>",
