      {
        "id": 218022,
        "name": "Jeysie",
        "username": "Jeysie",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/jeysie/{size}/1868_2.png",
        "created_at": "2018-05-17T15:01:08.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Discussions elsewhere made me realize this episode was interesting for having the trope \"citizens innocently help the bad guys and hurt the heroes trying to save them not because they want to actively be bad guys but because they don't really know better\" that happens lots in RL comics and Marvel especially but not very often in Sentinels.</p>",
